# The build context for infra/api.Dockerfile is the repository root, so everything here
# is sent to the daemon before a single COPY runs. None of this belongs in an image:
#
#   .mypy_cache      62 MB under apps/api and 30 MB under tools/pipeline in a used checkout
#   .venv            copied over /app/.venv by `COPY apps/api/ ./`, with the host's
#                    absolute paths baked into its scripts -- a broken interpreter
#   node_modules     the web app's, which this image does not contain
#   var/             worker run workdirs (WORKER_WORKDIR); capture bytes, not code
#
# Anything the image needs must not be listed here: apps/api, tools/pipeline and
# tools/captures are copied by the Dockerfile and are deliberately absent below.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/dist
**/var
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
data/tiles
